error[Z0406]: `dist.hypergeometric` needs `draws`
 --> scripts/main.zeff:1:6
  |
1 | dist.hypergeometric(successes: 10, failures: 7)
  |      ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ `draws` is missing
  |
  = help: usage: `dist.hypergeometric(successes, failures, draws)`

error[Z0413]: `draws` of `dist.hypergeometric` must be at most `successes` plus `failures`: the draws are made without replacement
 --> scripts/main.zeff:1:56
  |
1 | dist.hypergeometric(successes: 10, failures: 7, draws: 20)
  |                                                        ^^ outside the parameter's domain
  |
  = help: `zeff help dist.hypergeometric` gives the domain of every parameter

